  unitName: Pisces of Tyranny (EU)
  unitId: 720176
  unitNumber: 7135
  description: In the world of the Noblesses, Lavinia wove her web ever larger, wielding
    greater and greater influence. The few people that knew her, feared her and thought
    she was untouchable... The day of her birthday, when the Pisces constellation
    lit up the sky, a single drop of dark water fell upon her out of a cloudless
    sky. Soon her spies had no more orders, and many wars were avoided. The Corruption
    respects neither rank, nor power.
  summonDesc: Nothing can stop the Corruption, it will go on spreading...
  fusionDesc: I can feel my grip on desolation increasing.
